Test data
---------

tests/truth/ holds JSON summaries and a netlist derived from KiCad demo projects (StickHub, pic_programmer,
ecc83-pp, multichannel_mixer, complex_hierarchy; https://gitlab.com/kicad/code/kicad, demos/). They remain under
the terms of the KiCad project and are credited to their authors.

Benchmark boards (Freerouting's PCBench set, the DAC 2020 set, KiCad demos) are fetched by scripts/fetch_fixtures.sh
into bench/data/ and are not part of this repository; each keeps its own licence. Renders of those boards in
report/ are credited to their original authors.
